From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shahbaz Youssefi <syoussefi@chromium.org>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 17:34:07 -0400
Subject: Translator: Fix name collision for long struct names

The known issue with struct name collisions turned out to be
exploitable, so the hashing solution alluded to in the comments is
implemented in this change.

Bug: chromium:566398391
Change-Id: I7953241159ec3917c79e6ff07044186b84bd579d
Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/angle/angle/+/8480635
Reviewed-by: Yuxin Hu <yuxinhu@google.com>
Commit-Queue: Shahbaz Youssefi <syoussefi@chromium.org>

